WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.990
- So "Legally Blonde" is 20-years old.

00:00:01.990 --> 00:00:02.950
We've talked about what's accurate,

00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:05.070
let's talk about what's not
accurate about this show.

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:07.490
- Yeah. Let's commence
with our usual torture.

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:08.940
- 1L classes at Harvard being taught

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:11.540
by a practicing lawyer,
not going to happen.

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:12.780
The 1L classes are usually taught

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:16.130
by some very prestigious professor
who was only a professor.

00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:17.590
There are practicing lawyers who teach,

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:20.060
but not in your 1L year
and not at Harvard Law.

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:23.080
1L's competing for an
in-school internship?

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.380
- You will also be competing
for one of my firm's

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:28.620
highly coveted four internship spots.

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:31.340
- What? You don't have a job
when you're in law school,

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:33.030
at least not at the top law schools.

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:34.400
You just simply don't have time

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:35.800
and you're not going to be competing

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:38.570
for some firm's internship
while you're in class.

00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:39.980
It's just, you don't have time for it.

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:41.490
- You're fired.

00:00:41.490 --> 00:00:43.060
I have no representation.

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:45.590
- Letting a first-year law
student try any portion

00:00:45.590 --> 00:00:48.810
of a major homicide criminal
case, not going to happen.

00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:49.740
That's insane.

00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:51.290
And of course the most unrealistic thing,

00:00:51.290 --> 00:00:53.020
law students having a social life.

00:00:53.020 --> 00:00:56.260
- No way! Is somebody at the
school actually having a party?

00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:58.130
- Not in your first year, you're not.

00:00:58.130 --> 00:00:59.380
- This case is dismissed.

